WEBVTT

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.000
This is so calming...

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.290
Hina, your floater's sinking.

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:14.330
It's pulling pretty strong!

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:15.200
Is it a horse mackerel?

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.450
I-I don't know.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.200
What is this fish?

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.370
Hina, be careful! This one's dangerous.

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:27.500
It's a spiney.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.410
S-Spiney? What a weird name.

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:34.790
Um, I think its proper name
is pinspotted spinefoot.

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:38.750
All of its fins are poisonous,
and it hurts really bad if you get stung.

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.660
They're super dangerous!

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:43.330
They look like they hurt...

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:45.750
Ya catch somethin'?

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.910
Hina caught a spiney!

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:51.830
Ooh, that's great! They're delicious!

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:54.500
Huh? What the heck is she talking about?

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.290
I've had them before, but they taste
extra fishy. They're not worth eating.

00:00:58.290 --> 00:00:59.950
Oh, really?

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:02.830
Here. Doesn't its skin stink?

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:03.950
You're right...

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:06.620
They hurt if they sting you,
they don't taste that great,

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:09.160
so let's just release it.

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:10.040
Wha--?!

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.620
The hell are ya doin'?! That's such a waste!

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:15.290
What? But they're gross.

00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:18.330
President, this fish smells really bad.

00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:20.870
They're super delicious, damn it!

00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:25.370
She's lying. Oh, I know.
She must like the gamy stuff.

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:28.040
Ah... Well, the president is like an old man.

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:30.040
I can hear ya!

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:31.750
Those fools...

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:33.870
Is something the matter?

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:35.950
Ohno! Perfect timing!

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:39.040
Go tell those first-years
how delicious spineys are.

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.120
Spiney... I see. I shall.

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:47.330
I caught another one!

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:49.120
Guess today's just a spiney kinda day!

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:51.910
Just like the president said,
spineys are really good.

00:01:51.910 --> 00:01:53.700
Ohno-<i>senpai</i>!

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:57.120
You'll be fine if you prep them
properly after catching them.

00:01:57.120 --> 00:02:01.620
First, you cut off all their
spiney fins with scissors.

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:04.910
There's a hidden spike here, too, so be careful.

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:06.410
Whoa! That's dangerous.

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:11.540
Once you cut off the fins, chop off
the head right by the spine with scissors.

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:15.450
Next, use a towel and rip out its guts.

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:19.080
What the heck? It looks like a lollipop!

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:22.790
Its intestines are really
long and look like this.

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:25.250
The insides of a spiney
have a really pungent smell,

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.290
but if you take them out
as soon as you catch them,

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:30.040
the smell won't transfer to the flesh.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:33.620
Here you go, have some sashimi.

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:37.700
Huh? It doesn't stink.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:40.540
Let's eat.

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:43.540
It's so good!

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.040
I'm home!

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:21.200
Oh. Hey, Hina. Did ya catch any more yummy fish?

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.950
I caught a lot...

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.200
...of spineys, that is.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.120
Are these any good?

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.410
Come on, Dad!

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:32.160
You can't judge a fish by its scales!

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:34.450
Spineys are super good!

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:38.370
Hina, dinner's all ready,
so go get changed real quick.

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:40.000
Okay.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:44.620
I turned the fish you caught into sashimi.
And we're having tempura, too.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:47.120
Wow, it looks so good!

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.950
What kind of fish is this?

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:52.790
It's whiting. Our neighbors gave us some.

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:53.830
Whiting?

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:55.330
Remember how yer grandpa always caught them

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:57.700
and made them into tempura in the summer?

00:04:57.700 --> 00:05:00.660
Oh, come to think of it...

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:03.370
Actually, I was too little and don't remember.

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:05.540
Let's eat!

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.120
"Breakwater Club" "Umino High School"

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.290
"Breakwater Club" "Umino High School"
So, President,

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:13.870
So, President,

