Oh, fine...

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:47.950
There ya go.

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.040
Okay...

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:50.660
You're way too far.

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:55.290
Whiting swim near the bottom in schools.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:58.790
After ya cast, reel in any of yer excess line,

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:02.040
then wait until yer sinker settles.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:05.370
Once it does, yer line will relax.

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:08.330
Oh, this is just like the
time with the flatheads.

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:13.330
Then ya slowly reel in yer line
and let yer rig drag down there.

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:19.290
As for the speed...
Probably about three seconds per full turn.

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:24.620
Oh, but this might be better for beginners...

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:27.660
Put yer rod down flat, don't use yer reel,

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:30.540
and pull your rig around like this.

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:33.080
Let's say about walking speed.

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:35.330
Once yer rod is completely sideways,

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:40.250
reel in yer line as ya return yer rod forward.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:42.700
Rinse and repeat.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:48.500
This way, ya get a better feel of the bottom.
Probably better for beginners.

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:51.540
Then I'll give that a try.

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:53.160
Whoa there.

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:54.830
Looks like they're catchin' on.

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:56.330
Did you catch any?

00:15:56.330 --> 00:16:01.040
Nah, that was just a light nibble.
Nothing hooked yet.

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:04.450
But they're nearby, so I'm going to stop moving.

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:08.830
I'll make sure the line is loose, so
they can suck up the bait and wait.

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:11.910
H-How long do you wait?

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:14.870
Maybe thirty seconds to a minute?

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:33.080
And there ya have it.

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:35.870
Wow, you're all so good...

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:36.950
You're so far away...

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:38.750
I'm scared of bugs.

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:43.410
But that method's how ya catch them with bugs.

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:46.290
I'm not sure if it's the same
way with the artificial ones.

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:48.250
But give it a shot.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:49.700
Hopefully you'll catch some.

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:52.450
Well, look how easy it was for them.

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:54.410
I'll definitely catch some!

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:58.910
Hiyah!

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:04.700
Come on...

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:06.950
Give me a wiggle...

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:16.370
Well, that was just my first try.

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:18.450
We've only just begun!

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:27.580
Hiyah!

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:30.120
Take that!

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:31.370
Hup!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:44.620
Why... Why will you not wiggle for me?

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:49.250
My arms are so shaky from casting my line
so many times... I can't anymore...

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:51.750
Did I catch one?!

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:14.000
I did it! I caught two!

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:14.870
--This is going better than I thought!

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:16.660
--But I'm doing the same thing...
Maybe artificial ones don't work.
--This is going better than I thought!

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:20.040
--But I'm doing the same thing...
Maybe artificial ones don't work.

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:24.540
But I can't use real ones...

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:37.120
She's not catching any at all.

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:40.870
Figure it out already.
You can't keep doing the same thing.

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:46.250
Try different things! It said to
do that right on the bait bag!

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:50.200
Ugh! I can't take it anymore!
Can I please show her how to do it?

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:52.620
Like I said earlier, nope.

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:55.330
Why, though? I feel bad for her.

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:57.660
It's easy to explain things,

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:00.950
but it's important to learn
why yer not catchin' anythin'

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:04.160
or how to catch things on yer own.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:07.290
Tsurugi said she was gonna
be assertive, remember?

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:11.080
Let's see how far she's gonna go.

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:18.290
But if Tsurugi asks for
some advice, y'all can tell her.

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:23.870
Come ask me... Come ask me...

00:19:23.870 --> 00:19:26.410
Let's wrap things up!

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:27.870
Okay.

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:30.080
Okay...

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:35.620
I couldn't catch a single one...

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:38.790
Wow... You caught a lot.

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:40.330
Y-Yeah...

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:42.830
How many did you catch, Natsumi?

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:46.120
Um... I think about ten?

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:50.500
No fair... Maybe artificial
bait just doesn't work.

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:53.200
I don't think that's true.

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:54.660
Ask me!

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:56.370
I give up.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:02.870
I can't touch live bait, so I guess
I just can't catch whiting.

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:04.830
She gave up so quickly!

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:06.750
I'll start cleaning up...

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:14.080
Tsurugi, come here a sec.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:15.620
Yes?

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.330
I'm home!

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:21.040
Dad, can I borrow your computer later?

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:22.580
Sure!

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:26.410
"How to catch whiting using artificial bait"

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:32.870
Tsurugi, I don't think the reason ya
couldn't catch any was because of the bait.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:38.950
The method I taught ya today is
how to catch them with live bait.

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:42.950
There's probably a different way
to catch them with artificial bait.

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:45.540
A different way...

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:48.910
Try to think about why ya
weren't able to catch any.

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:51.830
Then ya can try again tomorrow.

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:53.540
O-Okay...

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:57.870
We used up all the live bait, so I guess
we're usin' the artificial stuff, too.

00:20:57.870 --> 00:20:59.910
We're counting on you, Hina.

00:20:59.910 --> 00:21:01.830
O-Okay...

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:05.410
This is a huge responsibility.

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:11.700
Let's see... "The biggest difference
between live and artificial bait..."

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:13.500
Oh, I see!

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:17.000
So whiting... I see.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.790
Change the length...

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:22.330
How to catch their attention...
Always move around...

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:28.250
Don't stay in one spot... Ah, I see.

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:32.000
Wow. I guess people do
all kinds of things to catch them.

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:35.500
There are so many different
things I want to try.

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:36.250
"Catching Whiting with Hyper Isome"
There are so many different
things I want to try.

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:40.410
"Catching Whiting with Hyper Isome"
I wonder why... I thought
I gave up on catching whiting...

00:21:40.410 --> 00:21:40.950
I wonder why... I thought
I gave up on catching whiting...

00:21:44.370 --> 00:21:48.620
But now, I want to catch one so badly!

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:54.580
Ugh! Let it be tomorrow already!
I'm definitely going to catch one!

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.120
Today's haiku...

00:21:58.120 --> 00:21:59.750
Look around the beach

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:01.250
and make sure you didn't leave

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:02.750
hooks and lines behind.

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:04.330
By Hina.
